"P984696474" "Test Subjects?"
// DetailString :
"P509094012" "You were told these were escaped genetic test subjects, but the reality is these are ghouls.<br><br>Neuron is either experimenting on the ghouls, or he is responsible for making them in the first place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MoreThanAFewClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2067299877" "Somebody Made a Big Mistake"
// DetailString :
"P2493386232" "You don't know who IVy got her information from, but there are a heck of a lot more ghouls in this warehouse than twenty. Something is not right here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HostagesClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2466778388" "Innocent Bystanders"
// DetailString :
"P2661431778" "The ghouls had gotten their hands on some innocent medical staff and who knows what they might have done to them if you hadn't come along."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - IDChitsClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1548987606" "ID Chits"
// DetailString :
"P312399819" "You found this handful of sub-dermal ID chits on a medical supply table. It would appear that the ghouls have been digging them out of themselves. No wonder there are so many more of them in here than IVy thought there were, only a fraction of them are showing up on the trackers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SurgicalToolsClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P430094913" "Used Surgical Tools"
// DetailString :
"P2055022780" "Piles of bloody gauze and unsanitized scalpels suggest that some form of surgery has been going on in here, but what and for what reason?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ShrapnelClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P682847392" "Shrapnel"
// DetailString :
"P1291878009" "You've found piles of small metal and plastic fragments covered in dried blood on some make shift medical supply tables. It looks like grenade shrapnel. Whoever the ghouls are playing with must not play very nice."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AlliesClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1652724030" "Forming Alliances"
// DetailString :
"P137540235" "You didn't catch all the details, but it sounded like the escaped test subjects and the ghouls from the tunnels are discussing an alliance. As if that wasn't bad enough, there was mention of a third party, and that could mean real trouble."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
