// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HWDU-644Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3753221090" "HWDU-644"
// DetailString :
"P53099878" "You found HWDU-644 not far from the junction into this branch of the tunnels. Recognizing you as a friendly it immediately started following you around, but could provide little information as to the whereabouts of its companion clockwork."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HWDU-159Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4128159521" "HWDU-159"
// DetailString :
"P2898964379" "HWDU-159 had found some rather unfriendly ghouls that were getting ready to deactivate it, permanently. Luckily you showed up in the nick of time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HWDU-998Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3834920133" "HWDU-998 Wreckage"
// DetailString :
"P692256295" ""HWDU-998 didn't come out of this so lucky. It appears that the clockwork was forcefully dismantled, and evidence of high energy burns can be seen on what remains of the metal chassis. Of concerning note is that HWDU-998's backup power supply is missing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MissingCanistersClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3503011198" "Missing Canisters"
// DetailString :
"P1335550054" "Something is wrong. The number of toxic waste canisters that are supposed to be down here does not match the paltry number you have found. Where have they gone to?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - IsotopeShrine1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3266876614" "A Shrine Made of Toxic Waste Canisters"
// DetailString :
"P3191168604" "Few things are as strange to you as the stack of toxic waste canisters arranged into a makeshift shrine."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - IsotopeShrine2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2508433630" "Isotope's Radiant Altar"
// DetailString :
"P3195908713" "You wouldn't believe it if you hadn't seen it and heard it yourself, but the twisted denizens of the tunnels appear to be worshipping their goddess, 'Isotope', at an altar made out of toxic waste drums that they call, 'The Radiant Altar'.<br><br>What in Emperor Cole's name is going on down here and who do you notify about this insanity?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PowerSupplyClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1390911629" "HWDU-998's Missing Power Supply"
// DetailString :
"P2335344345" "Amidst the 'Radiant Altar's' barrels of radioactive sludge and strange offerings you found HWDU-998's missing anti-matter power supply. It appears to be leaking from a small hole punched into it from what you guess to be a length of steel rebar. It would be best to get this somewhere safe incase the leak is harmful, or a precursor to a critical meltdown."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2121333419" "Several hazardous waste disposal units were dispatched to the tunnels beneath Neutropolis to secure some hazardous waste canisters being stored in a now unsecure location. We have lost contact with them. I have now been ordered to requisition aid from Powers Division to locate the units and complete their objective."
// SendOffString :
"P2527901718" "There is a high likelyhood that hostiles have overtaken the HWDUs and are planning on seizing the hazardous waste for their own misguided ends. Stop them at all costs."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P403477253" "secure Toxic Waste Canisters"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
