// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TunnelWarClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1808699425" "Tunnel Wars"
// DetailString :
"P648541754" "All is not peaceful down in the tunnels. It appears that the Chosen of Isotope regard all others as false ones, and the Ghouls just see food. Some deaths are worse than others and you can imagine few more atrocious than at the hands of mad cultists who revere radioactive waste as a goddess."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SplinterFactionsClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3389644914" "Cultists and Cannibals"
// DetailString :
"P3349039107" "It would seem that the varied origins of Neuron's failed experiments have manifested into splinter factions within the tunnels. Most vocal are the insane radioactive cultists known as the Chosen of Isotope, but lesser know inhuman creatures stalk the dark places beneath Praetoria. They are called Ghouls, and their mutated bodies starve for the flesh of the living.<br><br>You wonder just what Neuron was trying to do when he made such abominations."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TunnelsSecureClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3188916983" "Tunnels Secure, For Now"
// DetailString :
"P892941526" "Though it is only a small section of the tunnels, the security of the undeground had to start somewhere. Four sentry guns now monitor a small, but vital crossroads beneath the city. The first step to a safer future."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P965013651" "I require powers division help with the security of the tunnels, {HeroName}. Analysis of your records shows that you would be optimal for this task."
// SendOffString :
"P1807451535" "Tunnel security is required at a key junction in the tunnels. From there we will expand security measures throughout the area, thereby eliminating the presence of undesireables beneath the streets of Neutropolis.<br><br>Initial defenses will consist of four automated sentry guns."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3605234604" "Set up Sentry Guns in Tunnels"

